  "$comment": [
    "MK2 operation -> MK3 operation, stated rather than guessed.",
    "MK2 named operations after their handler ('patchValue', 'exportRaw'); MK3 names them after the",
    "contract ('edit.content', 'export.raw'). No heuristic should be trusted to connect those, so",
    "each pair is written here and check-operation-parity.mjs verifies both ends still exist.",
    "A value of { absent: <reason> } records an MK2 operation MK3 deliberately does not offer.",
    "It is checked too: the gate fails when the named MK3 id later appears, so the note cannot rot."
  ],
